    "title": "Poplar Bluff firefighters to host free Splash Tour event at Hendrickson Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sasha Moore ,\n13 hours ago POPLAR BLUFF, Mo., (KBSI) — Poplar Bluff firefighters are giving families another opportunity to cool off during the summer heat with the third stop of the PBFD Splash Tour. The Poplar Bluff Fire Department and IAFF Local 2543 will host the free event from 4 to 6 p.m. Thursday, Aug. 13, at Hendrickson Park. Read full article\n1",
